<title>MEXICO: Mexico rubber workers get 20 percent salary raise.</title>
<headline>Mexico rubber workers get 20 percent salary raise.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican rubber workers received a 20 percent salary hike Thursday, the Labor Ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>The ministry said &quot;workers and businessmen of the rubber manufacturing industry agreed...to revise the contract and to a salary increase of 20 percent.&quot;</p>
<p>The agreement follows a strike planned for Thursday if the workers had not arrived at an agreement with rubber industry business owners.</p>
<p>((--Veronica Galan, Mexico City newssroom +525 728-9553))</p>
</text>
